    "pb_brand_intro": {
      "type": "pb-feature-rows",
      "blocks": {
        "row_1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "text",
            "heading": "Protection Beyond the Surface.",
            "text": "<p>Advanced Graphene Ceramic Protection. Exclusively Available Through Premium Automotive Dealerships.</p><p>Developed by Protection Brands, CERFACE is a premium vehicle protection system designed to enhance, protect and preserve your vehicle’s appearance for years to come. Available through a select network of automotive dealerships, CERFACE combines advanced protection technology with professional application to deliver lasting results and exceptional visual appeal.</p><p>At the heart of CERFACE is an advanced Graphene-Enhanced Ceramic Coating that forms a durable protective layer over your vehicle's paintwork. Designed to enhance gloss, colour depth and clarity, it also helps defend against Australia's harsh environmental conditions and everyday contaminants.</p><p>Its smooth, hydrophobic finish helps repel water, dirt and road grime, making cleaning easier while helping to maintain a cleaner, more polished appearance. CERFACE also provides resistance to common environmental contaminants such as bird and bat droppings, tree sap, UV exposure and airborne pollutants.</p>",
            "label": "CERFACE"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "row_1"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "row_gap": 96,
        "background": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#111111"
      }
    },
